WEBVTT

00:01:57.613 --> 00:02:01.784
yo’lda bir xil miqdordagi
shamlardan o’tish orqali.

00:02:02.118 --> 00:02:04.745
Agarda boshidagi sham o’chirilgan bo’lsa

00:02:04.745 --> 00:02:08.040
siz aylanib chiqdingiz va
gigantning yoshini bilib oldingiz!

00:02:08.332 --> 00:02:12.837
Aks holda, keyingi sham yonguncha
davom etib, yana yo’lga chiqing,

00:02:12.837 --> 00:02:15.631
bu birinchisi ekanligini tekshiring 
va hokazo.

00:02:15.965 --> 00:02:17.884
Bu ishlaydi... Oxir-oqibat.

00:02:17.884 --> 00:02:21.512
Lekin gigant yosh emas va
ko’p shamlar yoniq bo’lsa,

00:02:21.721 --> 00:02:25.141
Sizda quyosh chiqishigacha
yugurish marafoni bo’lishi mumkin.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:29.812
U yeyishni boshlaganida, siz, albatta,
tortda bo’lishni xohlamaysiz.

00:02:29.937 --> 00:02:32.440
Shunday ekan, boshqa samaraliroq
usulga qaraymiz.